{"id":"td-1646","category":"teardown","cover":"🔧","region":"global","publishedAt":"2023-11-17","tags":["拆解分析","马自达"],"title":{"zh":"【粉丝投稿-车灯拆解2310】马自达CX-30大灯","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"原创 车灯研究院\n\n曾几何时，马6红遍大江南北，随着电动浪潮风起云涌，本来就小众的马自达，现如今已如履薄冰，还经常被人调侃为开着塞车的小众品牌，昔日的弯道舞者也只能靠降价勉强维持生","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"原创 车灯研究院\n\n曾几何时，马6红遍大江南北，随着电动浪潮风起云涌，本来就小众的马自达，现如今已如履薄冰，还经常被人调侃为开着塞车的小众品牌，昔日的弯道舞者也只能靠降价勉强维持生活这样子……今天要拆解的是CX-30，一款小型SUV的前大灯。\n\n整车外观还是延续家族的“魂动”风格，灯的造型相对其他日系车厂来说，柳叶造型，比较犀利，漂亮。\n\n(上图皆来源于Mazda为官网)\n\n今天的主角，马自达CX30前大灯，查了一下应该是中配，不带AFS，美版中配头灯在IIHS 的头灯测试环节中取得了Good的评价。(高配头灯因为炫光，成绩为POOR)。整灯进口，生产厂家为Stanley。\n\n背面整灯在车上看着不大，隐藏在前保的体积较多。\n\n第一部先把电脑版拆了，泰国三菱产。三菱车退市了，松田还能坚持多久？\n\n密密麻麻二几十颗线。\n\n加热，分离LENS为PC双色成型，市面普遍采用。\n\n灯线，左边两个分别是调整电机和灯光控制插头。\n\n进一步拆解，装饰框(左上)和日行灯模组(右上)，远近光一体模组还在HOUSING上。\n\n将调整电机和远近光一体模组拆下。\n\n拆下的模组，正面（左）背面（右）。\n\n拆之！支架，装饰框，模组，线束。\n\n核心部件\n\n透镜背面，看着很复杂，远近光变光通过LED和透镜的折射完成\n\n继续\n\n主光源分解\n\n15颗LED\n\n日行灯模组\n\n分解，零件还是挺多的，塑料件材质都是PC\n\n两块基板正反两面，一共三颗LED至此，全部拆解完成！整灯结构并不复杂，零件配合紧凑，做工规整，只是在国产车灯这两年飞速进步下，显得中规中矩了。这篇拆解来自网友投稿。","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/dengjuchaijie/1646.html","author":""},"media":{"images":["https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/Fhh_WIsEqJ6hz8AxK7Gsyqos-3kC.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FoXAF0iQKzYv6lIqY_JFP-AjBJ8l.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FultIvfEkihIMyCbLOLWU6XRFK83.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FkMUYsJ3MFzl0uqdJqZ__6BU-BAE.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FjveaGyXR5RfmJibEqMDcS0oTGus.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FuegPWsMxwUeIgbh8INmnx-f4rRt.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FnY9NxaTNCSEcXFmirCLHRNEJQqZ.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FmpxehMRYA6hIjss7y8ZIfvk2Dfw.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FqZk8lggayt8cX3QgXQYwq1sWUB0.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FuYeFPWxRliMbPLA17kaZhFKU42R.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/Fj2wMKahlcZNsmQbhhVY46tk-IJ_.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FuE2LVG_SOVixhNUkD3DpApozdXo.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/Fk-Q8P1T_P_B2l_V4pEiHBCrLDE_.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FrYlJiYbMMhP567SWddNqrtUpajY.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FnJifwTZlQa0nK4p9EqDuexiiEJV.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/Fuyqak3-hSnLDzotSYWOf4jbqpnD.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FlFXH5AdYfwC8wP_BCououUXfklc.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/Fpb4ymn_T3w_nu4I4G8y2WGbxdAk.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FrtuFgKoMwc8SCHJjW37Cjj__Hej.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FnKrN1jlc-IKaI0U_pKCJtRqJthw.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/Fn_P3-wIMIOgDlBV69vJJaPW7t5A.png","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/bfpNckwxSiaPsAHdYo5Rm51Zq8L8qaGeDE0KY989x9vVDV809H4cricuw3BibzQVul1Fqm7QvXAanIS3Drvs3Teow/640?wx_fmt=gif&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1"],"video":"","videos":[]},"full":true,"addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:25:15.746Z","content":[{"t":"text","v":"原创 车灯研究院"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/Fhh_WIsEqJ6hz8AxK7Gsyqos-3kC.png"},{"t":"text","v":"曾几何时，马6红遍大江南北，随着电动浪潮风起云涌，本来就小众的马自达，现如今已如履薄冰，还经常被人调侃为开着塞车的小众品牌，昔日的弯道舞者也只能靠降价勉强维持生活这样子……今天要拆解的是CX-30，一款小型SUV的前大灯。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FoXAF0iQKzYv6lIqY_JFP-AjBJ8l.png"},{"t":"text","v":"整车外观还是延续家族的“魂动”风格，灯的造型相对其他日系车厂来说，柳叶造型，比较犀利，漂亮。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FultIvfEkihIMyCbLOLWU6XRFK83.png"},{"t":"text","v":"(上图皆来源于Mazda为官网)"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20231117/FkMUYsJ3MFzl0uqdJqZ__6BU-BAE.png"},{"t":"text","v":"今天的主角，马自达CX30前大灯，查了一下应该是中配，不带AFS，美版中配头灯在IIHS 的头灯测试环节中取得了Good的评价。(高配头灯因为炫光，成绩为POOR)。整灯进口，生产厂家为